# Lasting Tarfire: "if you put a counter on a creature this turn" - a creature is a creature permanent (CR 109.2); a creature
# card in exile is not one. Bot1 controls Dauthi Voidwalker and Tarfire and bolts Bot2's Llanowar Elves on turn 3: the Elves
# are exiled instead with a void counter Bot1 puts on them (Dauthi's effect, CR 609.1), on a creature card, not a creature, so
# no damage at the end step: Bot2 stays at 20.

